/*
  MQTTStatusWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0068 · MQTTStatusWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `MQTTStatusWidget` resolves (table "MQTTStatusWidget") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/MQTTStatusWidget.tsx); the remainder back the
  native-only chrome (freshness chip, status words, refresh/retry/empty/error
  copy, relative-time buckets, accessibility).
*/

